  "geometry": "No geometry edits. Retain existing simple tyre rings/rail profiles and source fence bodies,29V/13T tent with original opening and6V/4T three-marshal card. Existing simplified near tree and all26 original woodland meshes retained. All decoded before/after geometry, UVs, normals, face/material slots, hierarchy and placements identical. Isolated material comparisons use canonical source geometry in all phases; driving context uses installed Mega resources.",
  "uv_contract": {
    "mapping": "Exact original name/size/BMP CRC32. Only Silverstone sources match the19 new entries; seven generic entries restricted/removed while all693 other baseline mappings and bytes remain unchanged.",
    "tyre_sides": "Seven stacks across, six tyre layers; original spacing/edge phase.",
    "tyre_tops": "Eight periods, upper centres0/12.5/.../100%, lower6.25/18.75/.../93.75%; stagger and clipped upper edges retained.",
    "tent": "Ford oval stays in lower source field U.265625..640625,V.6875..921875; original wall UVs endV.666687, so roof triangles carry logo and side panels stay plain. Navy top valance retained.",
    "marshal": "Three original poses/heights and exact black-key silhouette; splitU.483856201171875, full-height charts. RGB colour bleed beneath source silhouette removes opaque backdrop wedges; unchanged source mask steps are intentional.",
    "rails": "Source horizontal profile bands, attachment locations, open gaps and white/blue palettes retained. TRACK2 reuses exact accepted ground identitya65c40a1."
  },
  "export": "Fresh AI artwork from originals; no source RGB upscale/pixelblock tracing. Crop only generated presentation padding (marshal figure-group crop removes surrounding backdrop); whole plate resized Lanczos to original aspect with longest edge512. WebP quality70/method6. Exact nearest-scaled original black-key alpha restored; all19 decoded masks verified. No extra game texture/slot or UV remap.",
